A/B: declare the second eMMC slot partition + rootdisk phandles (mt7986/R3-mini).

Adds a `production_b` block-partition node and /chosen rootdisk-emmc-a/-b phandles
(referencing emmc_rootdisk / emmc_rootdisk_b) so 311+z03 ft_system_setup can point
/chosen/rootdisk at the active slot. r3-mini's DTS is a single base .dts in
target/linux/mediatek/dts/ (DEVICE_DTS_DIR=../dts, like r4-lite) -> base-files
patch via `git apply` (strict/atomic; two well-separated hunks are safe here, no
quilt silent-drop). chosen and partitions are ~250 lines apart -> two hunks.
--- a/target/linux/mediatek/dts/mt7986a-bananapi-bpi-r3-mini.dts
+++ b/target/linux/mediatek/dts/mt7986a-bananapi-bpi-r3-mini.dts
@@ -30,6 +30,8 @@
 	chosen {
 		stdout-path = "serial0:115200n8";
 		rootdisk-emmc = <&emmc_rootdisk>;
+		rootdisk-emmc-a = <&emmc_rootdisk>;
+		rootdisk-emmc-b = <&emmc_rootdisk_b>;
 		rootdisk-spim-nand = <&nand_rootdisk>;
 	};
 
@@ -283,6 +285,9 @@
 				emmc_rootdisk: block-partition-production {
 					partname = "production";
 				};
+				emmc_rootdisk_b: block-partition-production_b {
+					partname = "production_b";
+				};
 			};
 		};
 	};
